      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹18.12 (vs ₹13.89 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹18.12 (up from ₹13.89 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.9b (down 8.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.43b (up 31% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 19% (up from 13% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
